      "title": "Live now",
      "items": [
        "Manager wakes every 2h; workers get bounded assignments",
        "Capture runs on the $0 browser path, serial, landed with truthful states",
        "Media backlog drains before classification; archive outlives live status"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Never restart",
      "items": [
        "Old worker, watchdog, Xvfb unit and retention timer are masked at the unit level",
        "ScrapingBee deleted; Apify is capped and paid captures are forbidden",
        "A failed check is never recorded as zero ads"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Planned",
      "items": [
